# Search-tool ignore list (ripgrep, VS Code search, AI agents).
# This folder is not a git repo, so .gitignore is not applied by search tools;
# without this file a search scans ~18k vendored/build files instead of ~70 source files.
# To search an ignored folder deliberately, pass its path directly (or use rg --no-ignore).
node_modules/
.next/
.data/
.data-e2e/
.data-sec/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
